   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "st2",
   "originalText": "2. Video Stabilizer\n• Fast feature tracking\n• Homography matrix\n• Jitter damping (Δ ≤ 2px)",
